{"id":"3dd875417abdd49f","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-teq.md","title":"Turing 等价","display":"df-teq — Turing 等价","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-teq","aliases":["20-df-teq"],"display":"df-teq — Turing 等价","chapter":"3","section":"3.4","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 3.4.1","source_pdf_pages":[96],"source_printed_pages":[60],"depends_on":["[[20-df-tred]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-teq"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-teq</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-teq — Turing 等价"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 3.4.1"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>96</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>60</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}teq}\\vdash\nA\\equiv_TB\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow A\\le_TB\\land B\\le_TA.\"><div class=\"ma